<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady/firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to firm. Demand moderate and supply light. Top $58.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    57.00-58.00</p>
<p>US 1-2    210-220 lbs    54.00-57.00</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-230 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-270 lbs    56.00-57.00</p>
<p>	    270-280 lbs    55.00-56.00</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    42.00-44.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    45.00-48.00</p>
</text>
